    "Learn This Skill If You Want To Win In The Next 2-3 Years\nThe Practical Playbook for Understanding Human Nature, Creating Value, and Persuading Ethically",
    "Introduction — The Skill Beneath Every Other Skill\nThe current learning environment can feel overwhelming. One person says to learn AI. Another says coding is the future. Someone else recommends marketing, content creation, entrepreneurship, or a traditional career. New tools and opportunities appear constantly, and the fear of choosing the wrong skill can become so strong that people delay choosing anything.",
    "The central idea of this playbook is that one capability can make almost every other capability more useful: understanding human nature.",
