        "Part I — Why Human Nature Is a Compounding Skill",
        "1.1 The problem of too many options\nWhen many opportunities appear at once, choosing becomes difficult. You might wonder:\n- Should I learn AI or coding?\n- Should I start a business or look for a job?\n- Should I build an audience through video, writing, or social media?\n- Will the skill I learn today still matter in two years?\n- Am I falling behind people who are already using new tools?\nThe problem is not necessarily a shortage of opportunities. It is the absence of a stable way to evaluate them.",
