        "1.2 Human nature as a meta-skill\nHuman nature is the study of how people think, feel, interpret situations, form preferences, make decisions, and behave.",
        "This does not mean memorising a list of psychological facts or pretending to read minds. It means learning to observe people accurately and understand the forces that shape their actions.",
