        "4.4 Writing survival-oriented messages\nA useful problem statement is:\n- Specific enough for the right person to recognise.\n- Accurate enough to be trusted.\n- Important enough to deserve attention.\n- Connected to a problem you can genuinely help solve.\nWeak: “Your life is falling apart and you need this now.”",
