        "It can involve:\n- Becoming more capable.\n- Earning greater independence.\n- Building something meaningful.\n- Developing a craft.\n- Improving health or relationships.\n- Gaining freedom to choose.\n- Contributing to something larger than oneself.\nA compelling offer connects a current problem with a believable future state.",
