        "10.2 Why boundaries can improve trust\nClear boundaries communicate:\n- Who the offer serves.\n- What level of experience is expected.\n- What the offer can and cannot do.\n- Which alternatives may be more suitable.\nThis helps people make informed decisions and can reduce dissatisfaction.",
